# Database Patterns (Drizzle ORM)

## Schema Definition

```typescript
// packages/db/src/schema.ts
export const createTable = pgTableCreator((name) => `pws-base_${name}`);

export const posts = createTable(
  "post",
  (d) => ({
    id: d.integer().primaryKey().generatedByDefaultAsIdentity(),
    name: d.varchar({ length: 256 }),
    userId: d.text().references(() => users.id, { onDelete: "cascade" }),
    createdAt: d.timestamp({ withTimezone: true })
      .default(sql`CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`)
      .notNull(),
    updatedAt: d.timestamp({ withTimezone: true })
      .$onUpdate(() => new Date()),
  }),
  (t) => [
    index("name_idx").on(t.name),
    index("post_user_id_idx").on(t.userId), // FK indexes
  ],
);
```

## Query Patterns

```typescript
// ✅ Query builder (type-safe)
const post = await ctx.db.query.posts.findFirst({
  where: eq(posts.userId, ctx.user.id),
  orderBy: [desc(posts.createdAt)],
});

// ✅ Insert
await ctx.db.insert(posts).values({ name: "New" });

// ✅ Update
await ctx.db.update(posts)
  .set({ name: "Updated" })
  .where(eq(posts.id, id));

// ✅ Delete
await ctx.db.delete(posts).where(eq(posts.id, id));

// ✅ Transactions
await ctx.db.transaction(async (tx) => {
  await tx.insert(posts).values({ name: "Post 1" });
  await tx.insert(posts).values({ name: "Post 2" });
});
```

## Index Strategy

- ✅ Index all foreign keys
- ✅ Index frequently queried fields
- ✅ Composite indexes for multi-column queries
- ✅ Index sort fields (createdAt, updatedAt)

## SQL Injection Prevention

```typescript
// ✅ Always use query builder (safe)
await db.query.users.findFirst({ where: eq(users.email, email) });

// ❌ NEVER string interpolation
sql`SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = '${email}'` // DANGEROUS
```
